# The self-contained Onboard install payload is pinned by raw-byte digests
# (stable MANIFEST.json treeSha256, runtime/template baselines). Checkout must
# reproduce the exact committed bytes on every OS: marking the package binary
# disables text conversion so Windows autocrlf cannot rewrite pinned payloads.
sbtd-workflow-onboard/** -text
# Canonical source for bundled license payloads must have the same bytes.
/LICENSE -text
